end's Mark” (max 40% Crit Chance)\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"line-1912","runs":[{"text":"\t3\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"line-1915","runs":[{"text":"\tConsumed by the Abyss\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"line-1916","runs":[{"text":"15 MP - CD 3s\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"line-1917","runs":[{"text":"Hybr - 2 targets\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"line-1918","runs":[{"text":"\tSelf 25% Haste trong 6s\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"line-1919","runs":[{"text":"Enemies -25% Dodge trong 6s\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"line-1920","runs":[{"text":"\t4\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"line-1923","runs":[{"text":"\tFiend Frenzy\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"line-1924","runs":[{"text":"25 MP - CD 26s\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"line-1925","runs":[{"text":"Hybr - 7 targets\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"line-1926","runs":[{"text":"\tAllies 120% Crit DMG trong 8s\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"line-1927","runs":[{"text":"Self nhận HoT trong 2s, tăng theo số stack “Archfiend's Mark”\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"line-1928","runs":[{"text":"\t5\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"line-1931","runs":[{"text":"\tAbyssal Contract\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"line-1932","runs":[{"text":"25 MP - CD 26s\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"line-1933","runs":[{"text":"Hybr - 2 targets\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"line-1934","runs":[{"text":"\tEnemies 30% Phys In trong 10s, thêm 5% với mỗi stack của “Mark of Death” (max 70% Phys In)\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"line-1935","runs":[{"text":"Note: Gây DMG tăng theo số stack của “Archfiend's Mark” và đồng thời tiêu hao hiệu ứng này.\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"line-1936","runs":[{"text":"\tP\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"line-1939","runs":[{"text":"\tPassive\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"line-1940","runs":[{"text":"Rank 4\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"line-1941","runs":[{"text":"\tSelf 30% Crit DMG nhưng -75% Magi Out\n"}]},{"type":"paragraph","id":"line-1942","runs":[{"text":"Self 12% Hit và Crit Chance